    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy and rules</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Last update: April 29, 2026&#10;&#10;HuertoCero lets people publish farm products, reserve products, save favorites and chat between buyer and seller.&#10;&#10;Data used:&#10;- Account: email and authentication data managed by Firebase Authentication.&#10;- Products: name, description, price, image, point-of-sale location and seller user.&#10;- Conversations: messages sent between buyer and seller.&#10;- Reservations and favorites: products you reserve or save.&#10;- Reports: notices sent to review products or conversations.&#10;&#10;Why it is used:&#10;- Create and protect your account.&#10;- Show products on the map.&#10;- Enable reservations, favorites and chat.&#10;- Review abuse, fraud or inappropriate content.&#10;&#10;Rules of use:&#10;- Publish only real and legal products.&#10;- Do not share offensive, illegal, fraudulent or dangerous content.&#10;- Do not use chat for spam, harassment or impersonation.&#10;- Purchase, delivery and payment agreements are the responsibility of buyer and seller.&#10;&#10;Reports and moderation:&#10;You can report products or conversations from the app. Reports are saved for review and may lead to content removal or account blocking.&#10;&#10;Security:&#10;HuertoCero uses Firebase for authentication, database and image storage. Before publishing, configure Firestore and Storage security rules and restrict the Google Maps key in Google Cloud.&#10;&#10;Contact:&#10;Use the developer email published in the Google Play listing for privacy, support or data deletion requests.</string>
